<p>You can pass parameters to an external component from the <code>.edit</code> file as simple <strong>key-value</strong> pairs (both strings).<br>
All external-component box types provide:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>findParam(key: string): string</code> — returns the parameter value (if present).</li>
</ul>


